  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong>Míralo Marketplace is a B2B export platform connecting Colombian suppliers with international buyers. We offer a curated catalog of authentic Colombian products across food, wellness, textiles, and more — with integrated logistics through Connecta Air Express and Connecta Logistics for seamless international shipping.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong>We are the bridge between Colombian craftsmanship and global demand. Unlike generic marketplaces, Míralo combines verified local suppliers, bilingual support, and end-to-end logistics — making it easy to source, buy, and ship products from Colombia to the world.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong>Affiliates earn commissions by promoting Míralo to international buyers, retailers, and distributors. Every confirmed purchase made through your referral link generates a direct commission. The more buyers you bring, the more you earn — no inventory required.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong>Share Míralo with importers, boutique stores, restaurants, and distributors looking for authentic Colombian products. Use your website, social media, email lists, or trade networks. We provide promotional materials, product catalogs, and landing pages to make your promotion easy and effective.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Other information:</strong>Míralo Marketplace operates from Colombia with logistics partners in Miami and Bogotá. We support both wholesale and small-batch orders, with flexible payment options and dedicated account support for affiliates and buyers.</p></div></div>",
